    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Force Unleashed Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Techniques\" title=\"Force Techniques\">Force Techniques</a></i> </p><p>When you use the <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Rage\" title=\"Dark Rage\">Dark Rage</a></i> Force Power, you ignore the restriction that prevents you from using <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a> or performing tasks that require patience and concentration. Additionally, you can always activate <i><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Dark_Rage\" title=\"Dark Rage\">Dark Rage</a></i> in the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>, even if you are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a>. </p>",
